<title>UK: SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and latest</p>
<p>positions in the the world professional snooker championship on</p>
<p>Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round (best-of-25 frames)</p>
<p>14-Alain Robidoux (Canada) beat Stefan Mazrocis (England) 13-9</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) leads 10-Steve Davis (England) 6-2</p>
<p>4-John Parrott (England) and Anthony Hamilton (England) level</p>
<p>at 4-4</p>
</text>
